From a95beb7f315fc024abcf71af294b7a4f676a3c18 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:59:21 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18h: host DevTools as registry tabs

Own a bundled DevTools frontend in the tab registry, with restricted UI bindings, target attachment, URL admission and independent close semantics. ABI 1.40 / bridge 0.42.0 (devtools).

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
